text = "CREDITS
=======

Creative Director — Aida Navarro Redón
Art Direction — Juana Miquel
Illustration — Rosalía Armenteros · Sabela Álvarez
Animation & Design — Léonie Courbat
Lead Programmer — Claire Delhomme
Programmer — Adrián Herrera Cosgaya
Sound Design — Alv_Adina
Testimonial Coordinator & Mental Health Counselor — Swann Pichon
Research & Consulting — Nora Doukkali Elamajidi
Gynaecological Advisor — Dr. Caroline Bensky
Midwife Advisor — Caterina Montagnoli

Video
  Chapters 1 & 3 — Maevia Griffiths
  Chapter 2 — Djiwel Filmz, Tiba Ink & Nora Doukkali
Trailer — Rio Bravo Trailers
─────────────────────
This project was funded by the University of Applied Sciences and Arts
Western Switzerland (HES-SO) grant \"Open and Participatory Innovation for
the Benefit of Society\" and developed at the Geneva School of Art and
Design (HEAD), with the invaluable collaboration of:

Anthony Masure — Head of the Research Institute in Art and Design, HEAD
Christelle Granite-Nobles — Secretary of the Research Institute in Art
and Design, HEAD

And in partnership with the Geneva School of Health Sciences (HEdS).
─────────────────────
This project was also partly supported by the Swiss National Science
Foundation project \"The Future of Humanitarian Design,\" hosted at the
Architecture Design department at HEAD and coordinated by Javier
Fernández Contreras.
─────────────────────
Partners
International Committee of the Red Cross (ICRC) — Melissa Kiehl, Head of
Digital External Engagement and Immersive Technologies at the ICRC.
International Red Cross and Red Crescent Museum (MICR) — Pascal Husmith,
Director.

In collaboration with
Geneva University Hospitals (HUG) — Dr. Caroline Bensky & Dr. Noémie
Cuissart de Grelle.
CEFAM Association (Reception and Integration Center for Migrant Women and
Their Preschool Children) — Belkis Tanriverdi, Head of Community
Programs.
The women members of CEFAM, for their participation in the Creative
Workshop \"Voices of Maternity in Migration\" at HUG.
